    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/8/48266.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 77,
    "turn_text": "Great pleasure talk to you. I got to tell you my heart is troubled because our politicians are I've forgotten exactly what they're elected for. You look to House of Representatives, their constitutional duty, number one, is to set spending. And they put it off like bad school kids who waited until they were about to fail the course before they did their own work.",
