        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "The primary constitutional duty of the U.S. House of Representatives is to set spending.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker's heart is troubled.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
