      {
        "text": "Delaying legislative responsibilities reflects poorly on the integrity of elected officials.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the House of Representatives as accountable to public expectations regarding fiscal responsibility.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a shared understanding between the speaker and listener about the importance of timely budgetary action.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
