    "turn_idx": 78,
    "turn_text": "No, it's not. I don't think they put it off. And fairness to them, they were trying to engage Joe Biden from the beginning. If anything, I think in the end, they gave much more than they otherwise needed to. And, you know, I, I've talked to a lot of people, all the different factions in the Republican Party, and there's been some anger and angst and, and I think going forward, hopefully they'll do it better. But I wouldn't have, I wouldn't have voted for that bill.",
